Protein Pal UART Protocol

 Objective

Implement UART communication between Raspberry Pi and MCU
for dispensing commands.

Communication

RPi → MCU:
CMD,101,DISPENSE,2,30.0,XX

MCU → RPi:
ACK,101

After dispensing:

DONE,101,30.40,0.40

 Files

- PROTOCOL.md – UART protocol specification
- rpi_controller.py – Raspberry Pi Python code
- mcu_controller.ino – MCU firmware

Protocol Features

- UART communication
- Command/response design
- ACK
- Checksum
- Timeout handling
- Error handling
- Command ID
